{%- comment -%}
  One tool recommendation, wherever it appears — the hub page or inside a guide.

  Parameters:
    name, url, role, who, problem, limits, alternative, basis, partner
    placement  — where this instance sits (analytics only)
    affiliate  — 'true' only when docs/monetization/PARTNER-REGISTER.md records
                 an APPROVED relationship and the url is the approved tracking
                 URL. Anything else must be left unset.

  The disclosure is rendered immediately above the link, never only in the
  footer, and only when the link is actually compensated. When it is not, the
  card says plainly that it is an ordinary link — the credibility of the
  recommendation is the product here, and a disclosure nobody needs is cheaper
  than a missing one.

  rel: sponsored + nofollow on a compensated link, per search-engine guidance
  for links with a commercial relationship; noopener on every external link.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_aff = false -%}
{%- if affiliate == 'true' or affiliate == true -%}{%- assign is_aff = true -%}{%- endif -%}
<article class="sbs-rec{% if is_aff %} sbs-rec--aff{% endif %}">
  <div class="sbs-rec__head">
    <h3>{{ name | escape }}</h3>
    <span class="sbs-rec__role">{{ role | escape }}</span>
  </div>
  {%- if is_aff -%}
    <p class="sbs-rec__disclosure"><strong>Affiliate link.</strong> If you sign up through this link, Site Builder Stack may earn a commission. It costs you nothing extra and does not change what is written below.</p>
  {%- endif -%}
  <dl class="sbs-rec__body">
    <dt>Who it suits</dt><dd>{{ who }}</dd>
    <dt>The problem it solves</dt><dd>{{ problem }}</dd>
    <dt>Limitations</dt><dd>{{ limits }}</dd>
    <dt>When you may not need it</dt><dd>{{ alternative }}</dd>
  </dl>
  <div class="sbs-rec__basis">{{ basis }}</div>
  <p class="sbs-rec__link">
    <a href="{{ url }}" target="_blank"
       rel="{% if is_aff %}sponsored nofollow noopener{% else %}noopener{% endif %}"
       data-sbs-affiliate="{{ partner | escape }}"
       data-sbs-affiliate-mode="{% if is_aff %}affiliate{% else %}editorial{% endif %}"
       data-sbs-placement="{{ placement | default: 'hub' | escape }}">{{ link_label | default: 'Official site' | escape }}</a>
    {%- unless is_aff -%}
      <span class="sbs-rec__plain">Ordinary link — no commission is earned from it.</span>
    {%- endunless -%}
  </p>
</article>
